	chapter.660321991978C7E8.title: " &b&lCreate: Aeronautics"
	quest.65A12AF7829E958F.title: "&bCreate: Aeronautics"
	quest.65A12AF7829E958F.quest_subtitle: "Make your Create contraptions actually fly."
	quest.65A12AF7829E958F.quest_desc: [
		"Aeronautics adds &ephysics structures&r on top of Create: assemble a group of blocks with a &ePhysics Assembler&r and it becomes subject to gravity, lift and thrust, so you can build airships, hot air balloons and vehicles."
		""
		"Stick the blocks you want assembled together with &eHoney Glue&r first."
		"Lift comes from &ehot air&r (a burner filling a sealed envelope) or from &eLevitite&r; powered &epropellers&r provide thrust."
		""
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Almost every Aeronautics block has a Ponder scene: hover over it and hold \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ponder.ponder\",\"color\":\"aqua\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
		""
		"It helps to finish the first rows of the &6Create&r chapter first so you are comfortable with rotational power."
	]
